# Rust build artifacts
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# UniFFI bindings ARE committed. The Kotlin SDK vendors the generated .kt as
# source (the same way it vendors zk-cred-*), so it has to be reviewable here
# and diffable when the FFI surface changes. `make check-bindings` compares the
# working tree against a fresh generation — which only means anything if the
# files are tracked.

# Differential-testing oracle, fetched at test time — never vendored.
# See CONTRIBUTING.md § Provenance.
/tests/oracle/

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Agent worktrees and session scratch — never part of a commit.
.claude/
scripts/__pycache__/

# Coverage report, generated by the SonarCloud workflow.
lcov.info
